{"title":"1993 OIM Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_OIM_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A natural number is a palindrome if, when written in decimal notation, it is the same when written from left to right and from right to left; for example: 8, 23432, 6446.\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/2/6f2b3db1410ca4fc99ef46125855d0f2a627100a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1&lt;x_2 &lt; \\cdots &lt; x_i&lt;x_{i+1}&lt; \\cdots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"253\" height=\"16\" /> be all the palindromes. For each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/34857b3ba74ce5cd8607f3ebd23e9015908ada71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"14\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/d/e9d10379bf2dc2eeb08778eab924bf23cfb6f817.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_{i+1} = x_{i+1}-x_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"128\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>How many different prime numbers does the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/e/8de9b57ad773a66f929d5d596257e3ad7aacc54a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{y_1,y_2,y_3,\\cdots \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"118\" height=\"20\" /> contain?\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n~ Edits by <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Eevee9406\">eevee9406</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_OIM_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1993_OIM_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_OIM_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe8.htm\">https://www.oma.org.ar/enunciados/ibe8.htm</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016222429\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 36/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 780/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.326      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    5.326      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26083:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016222429 and revision id 245858. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}